                    },
                    "message": "We should do some doc clean up first :/ \n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/f4b579092747a8053d1a3a9d3347bda50634129f/REST-cheatsheet.md?plain=1#L49\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/f4b579092747a8053d1a3a9d3347bda50634129f/REST-cheatsheet.md?plain=1#L49\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/f4b579092747a8053d1a3a9d3347bda50634129f/REDFISH-cheatsheet.md?plain=1#L39\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/6d2ab689e2482f8cd22455e0c0cbb7534f71f881/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Logging/README.md?plain=1#L75"
