                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "You linked the first blob twice (Rest-cheatsheet line 49).  That one is still supported by this change.  Looking there there was one example that was wrong, so it is corrected in https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/86835\n\nThe Redfish cheatsheet on line 39 is also still supported.\n\nI've proposed just removing PDI entirely:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/86836\n\n\nLets see how these patches shake out."
                },
